(7679270, 1255947, 86218, '<td valign="top">We have nothing like this scene in SA. What a place to photograph..BUT being a South African more familiar with sun and warmth I struggle with cold and this looks bitterly so. Beauty like this I much rather Appreciate on photos such as this yet perhaps one day can experience it for myself. Great work Dennis</td>', 'We have nothing like this scene in SA. What a place to photograph..BUT being a South African more familiar with sun and warmth I struggle with cold and this looks bitterly so. Beauty like this I much rather Appreciate on photos such as this yet perhaps one day can experience it for myself. Great work Dennis', '2020-11-11 00:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
